## Introduction & Overview

### What is Azure Data Factory?

**Azure Data Factory (ADF)** is a fully managed, cloud-based data integration service that allows you to create, schedule, and orchestrate data workflows at scale.

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│     AZURE DATA FACTORY                  │
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ ✓ Cloud-native ETL/ELT service         │
│ ✓ Serverless architecture               │
│ ✓ No infrastructure management          │
│ ✓ Pay-per-execution pricing             │
│ ✓ Visual pipeline designer              │
│ ✓ Code-free data transformation         │
│ ✓ 90+ pre-built connectors              │
│ ✓ Integration with Power BI, Synapse    │
│ ✓ Hybrid data integration               │
│ ✓ Enterprise-grade security             │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

