}

Blob Storage Sinks:
├─ copyBehavior: PreserveHierarchy/FlattenHierarchy/MergeFiles
├─ fileNamePrefix: Add prefix to output files
├─ partitionedBy: Create folder structure
├─ Example: data/@{dataset().PartitionYear}/@{dataset().PartitionMonth}/file.csv
├─ Benefit: Organized, query-able data lake

Cosmos DB Sinks:
├─ upsert mode: INSERT or UPDATE
├─ writeThroughputSettings: Scale RUs during copy
├─ Example: Increase RUs before load, decrease after
├─ Benefit: Optimize cost during bulk operations
```

