**Authentication Decision Tree:**
```
Do you have a Managed Identity? 
├─ YES → Use Managed Identity (Best Practice)
│   ├─ System-assigned (simplest, per ADF)
│   ├─ User-assigned (for sharing across resources)
│   └─ Grant RBAC roles to target resources
│
└─ NO → Use Service Principal
    ├─ Create Azure AD Application
    ├─ Generate client secret
    ├─ Grant RBAC roles
    ├─ Configure Linked Service with credentials
    └─ Rotate secrets regularly (every 6 months)

Legacy Option: SQL Authentication
