## Performance Optimization

### Comprehensive Performance Tuning Framework

**Performance Optimization Decision Tree:**
```
Identify Performance Issue
├─ Slow Copy Activity?
│   ├─ Check source throughput (query optimization)
│   ├─ Check sink throughput (indexing, batch size)
│   ├─ Increase parallelCopies (for large files)
│   ├─ Increase DIU allocation (for high volume)
│   ├─ Enable staging (for SQL Server sink)
│   └─ Review network bandwidth utilization
│
├─ Slow Data Flow?
│   ├─ Check source data volume (add filters early)
│   ├─ Optimize joins (join on indexed columns)
│   ├─ Enable caching (for repeated reads)
│   ├─ Increase cluster size (for compute-heavy)
│   ├─ Repartition data (if skewed)
│   └─ Reduce transformations (pre-aggregate)
│
└─ Slow Pipeline?
    ├─ Run activities in parallel (when possible)
    ├─ Reduce pipeline frequency (batch instead of near-real-time)
    ├─ Pre-filter data (reduce volume processed)
    ├─ Consolidate lookups (single lookup vs multiple)
    └─ Use incremental loads (not full refresh)
```

