**Q13: Describe a real-world scenario: Multi-Source Data Consolidation Pipeline**

A: **Scenario**: Company has customer data in 3 systems (Salesforce CRM, SAP ERP, On-Premises SQL Server). Need to consolidate into single customer master in Synapse Analytics daily.

```
Business Requirements:
├─ Combine 3 customer sources
├─ Resolve duplicates (fuzzy match on name/email)
├─ Daily refresh at 2 AM UTC
├─ SLA: Complete within 30 minutes
├─ Data quality: <0.1% error rate
└─ Compliance: GDPR-compliant with audit trail

Architecture:

Source Systems:
├─ Salesforce CRM (API-based)
├─ SAP ERP (OData API)
└─ On-Premises SQL Server (Self-Hosted IR)

ADF Pipeline Structure:
├─ Extract stage: Copy each source to staging layer
├─ Transform stage: Consolidate and deduplicate
├─ Load stage: Write to Synapse
└─ Validation stage: Data quality checks

Detailed Implementation:

{
  "name": "CustomerMasterConsolidation",
  "parameters": [
    {"name": "ExecutionDate", "type": "string"}
  ],
  "triggers": [{
    "type": "Schedule",
    "frequency": "Day",
    "startTime": "02:00:00"
  }],
  "activities": [
    {
      "name": "ExtractSalesforce",
      "type": "Copy",
      "description": "Get active customers from Salesforce",
      "typeProperties": {
        "source": {
          "type": "SalesforceSource",
          "query": "SELECT Id, Name, Email, Phone, Industry FROM Account WHERE Active = true"
        },
        "sink": {"path": "lake/staging/salesforce/@{pipeline().parameters.ExecutionDate}/"},
        "dataIntegrationUnits": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ExtractSAP",
      "type": "Copy",
      "description": "Get customers from SAP via OData",
      "typeProperties": {
        "source": {
          "type": "ODataSource",
          "query": "Customer?$filter=Status eq 'Active'"
        },
        "sink": {"path": "lake/staging/sap/@{pipeline().parameters.ExecutionDate}/"}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ExtractOnPremises",
      "type": "Copy",
      "description": "Get customers from on-premises SQL via Self-Hosted IR",
      "typeProperties": {
        "source": {
          "type": "SqlSource",
          "sqlReaderQuery": "SELECT CustomerID, Name, Email, Phone FROM Customers WHERE Status='Active'"
        },
        "sink": {"path": "lake/staging/onprem/@{pipeline().parameters.ExecutionDate}/"},
        "integrationRuntime": "OnPremisesIR"
      },
      "linkedServiceName": "OnPremisesSQLServer"
    },
    {
      "name": "ConsolidateAndDeduplicate",
      "type": "DataFlow",
      "description": "Merge 3 sources, apply business rules, deduplicate",
      "typeProperties": {
        "dataflow": {
          "referenceName": "CustomerConsolidationFlow"
        },
        "computeType": "General",
        "coreCount": 16
      },
      "dependsOn": [
        {"activity": "ExtractSalesforce", "dependencyConditions": ["Succeeded"]},
        {"activity": "ExtractSAP", "dependencyConditions": ["Succeeded"]},
        {"activity": "ExtractOnPremises", "dependencyConditions": ["Succeeded"]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ValidateDataQuality",
      "type": "Lookup",
      "description": "Check quality metrics before load",
      "typeProperties": {
        "source": {
          "sqlReaderQuery": "SELECT COUNT(*) as TotalRecords, COUNT(CASE WHEN Email IS NULL THEN 1 END) as NullEmails FROM staging_consolidated"
        }
      },
      "dependsOn": [{"activity": "ConsolidateAndDeduplicate"}]
    },
    {
      "name": "CheckQualityThreshold",
      "type": "IfCondition",
      "expression": "@lessOrEquals(activity('ValidateDataQuality').output.firstRow.NullEmails * 100 / activity('ValidateDataQuality').output.firstRow.TotalRecords, 0.1)",
      "ifTrueActivities": [
        {
          "name": "LoadToSynapse",
          "type": "Copy",
          "typeProperties": {
            "source": {"path": "lake/staging/consolidated/"},
            "sink": {
              "type": "SqlPoolSink",
              "preCopyScript": "TRUNCATE TABLE dbo.CustomerMaster",
              "writeBatchSize": 50000,
              "writeBatchTimeout": "01:00:00"
            },
            "enableStaging": true,
            "dataIntegrationUnits": 32
          }
        }
      ],
      "ifFalseActivities": [
        {
          "name": "FailDueToQuality",
          "type": "WebHook",
          "url": "https://alert-service.com/notify",
          "body": {
            "message": "Customer consolidation failed quality checks",
            "errorRate": "@{activity('ValidateDataQuality').output.firstRow.NullEmails}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "RefreshSynapseViews",
      "type": "SqlPoolStoredProcedure",
      "description": "Refresh materialized views for BI",
      "typeProperties": {
        "storedProcedureName": "sp_RefreshCustomerViews"
      },
      "dependsOn": [{"activity": "LoadToSynapse"}]
    },
    {
      "name": "NotifyCompletion",
      "type": "WebHook",
      "url": "https://notification-service.com/success",
      "body": {
        "pipeline": "@{pipeline().Pipeline}",
        "runId": "@{pipeline().RunId}",
        "recordCount": "@{activity('ValidateDataQuality').output.firstRow.TotalRecords}",
        "duration": "@{activity('LoadToSynapse').output.executionDuration}"
      },
      "dependsOn": [{"activity": "RefreshSynapseViews"}]
    }
  ]
}
```

**Key Points in This Scenario**:
- Three copy activities run in parallel (extract stage)
- Depends-on after all three complete (wait for all)
- Data quality validation before load (gates the load)
- Conditional branching (if quality OK, load; else alert)
- Staging enabled for Synapse (PolyBase performance)
- Notification on completion (monitoring)

